Maintainer: Lejla Dervisevic <derviseviclejla3@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: firewall-threat-detection
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-sklearn, python3-numpy, python3-requests
Description: Real-time firewall log analysis and threat detection
 A lightweight tool for Debian-based Linux systems that monitors UFW logs,
 detects suspicious activity using FireHOL blacklists and a Random Forest
 ML model, stores threats in SQLite, and sends email alerts.
